### --- 编译产物 (Build Artifacts) --- ###
# 排除所有 build 文件夹
[Bb]uild/
bin/
obj/
out/

# 排除常见的可执行文件后缀
*.exe
*.out
*.app
*.dll
*.so*
*.dylib

### --- 中间产物 (Intermediate Files) --- ###
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.la
*.lo
*.pch
*.gch

### --- 构建系统相关 (Build System) --- ###
# CMake
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
CMakeScripts/
cmake_install.cmake
install_manifest.txt
compile_commands.json

# Makefile
.deps/
.libs/
Makefile.in

### --- IDE / 编辑器配置 --- ###
# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.sln
*.vcxproj
*.filters

# VS Code
#.vscode/
# 注意：如果你想分享任务配置，可以不忽略 .vscode/tasks.json

# CLion / JetBrains
#.idea/
cmake-build-*/

